                <h1 class="text-[32px] md:text-[46px] font-extrabold tracking-tight leading-[0.95]">Avoid Credit Repair Scams: 5 Red Flags the CFPB Warns About</h1>
                <p class="mt-4 text-[17px] leading-7 text-slate-500 max-w-[680px]">If someone promises to fix your credit overnight for $499 upfront, it's a scam. Here's how to spot illegal credit repair, what legitimate help actually looks like, and free ways to rebuild your score yourself.</p>

                <!-- Author Box -->
                <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 p-4 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-100">
