                    <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-[11.5px] leading-6 text-slate-600"><b>Methodology:</b> This guide is based on CFPB consumer alerts, Credit Repair Organizations Act (CROA), FTC vs. credit repair cases, and data from Experian & Equifax on dispute rights. US-focused. No personal data collected.</div>
                </div>

